WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.461
Drew sighed.

2
00:00:02.481 --> 00:00:06.505
"I have nothing to do," he said.

3
00:00:06.805 --> 00:00:08.106
"I'm so bored!"

4
00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:15.892
He lay on the sofa and stared up at the ceiling.

5
00:00:33.228 --> 00:00:35.189
Dad walked into the living room.

6
00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:40.910
are you doing, Drew?"

7
00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.070
Dad asked.

8
00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:46.532
"I'm bored," said Drew.

9
00:00:46.552 --> 00:00:49.352
"Bored?" said Dad.

10
00:00:49.372 --> 00:00:53.513
"There's nothing to do," said Drew.

11
00:00:54.194 --> 00:00:55.794
He slid off the sofa.

12
00:00:57.194 --> 00:00:59.255
His feet were still on the sofa.

13
00:01:00.375 --> 00:01:03.016
But his head was now under the coffee table.

14
00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:06.821
"Hmm," said Dad.

15
00:01:06.841 --> 00:01:08.822
"Come with me."

16
00:01:13.444 --> 00:01:15.464
Drew followed Dad to the kitchen.

17
00:01:15.484 --> 00:01:20.667
"These dishes are dirty," said Dad.

18
00:01:20.687 --> 00:01:26.049
"Since you have nothing to do, you can wash them."

19
00:01:33.112 --> 00:01:33.812
said Drew.

20
00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:42.754
He filled the sink with hot, soapy water.

21
00:01:46.097 --> 00:01:47.498
Then he got to work.

22
00:01:51.421 --> 00:01:54.663
When Drew was done, he went back to the living room.

23
00:01:54.683 --> 00:01:59.847
"Oh, hi, Drew," said Dad.

24
00:01:59.867 --> 00:02:02.528
"I was going to vacuum the living room.

25
00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:07.392
But since you're bored today, you can do it."

26
00:02:13.176 --> 00:02:14.897
Drew vacuumed the living room.

27
00:02:22.503 --> 00:02:25.105
Next he helped Dad weed the garden.

28
00:02:29.989 --> 00:02:33.152
Then he peeled potatoes and set the table.

29
00:02:43.612 --> 00:02:45.814
During dinner Drew was tired.

30
00:02:45.835 --> 00:02:49.839
"That was a busy day," he said.

31
00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:51.901
Dad smiled.

32
00:02:51.921 --> 00:02:54.704
"Anytime you're bored, just let me know!"

33
00:02:55.805 --> 00:02:56.766
Drew laughed.

34
00:02:57.187 --> 00:02:59.249
"I'll never say I'm bored again!"
